# Wall-clock waits and fixed ports in tests that predate hack/verify-test-sleeps.sh.
# One entry per file and symbol: <path>:<symbol> <reason> <deadline YYYY-MM-DD>.
# The seeded deadlines are staggered by package, one package a week, so they do
# not all expire together. Fixing a test means deleting its entry and lowering
# the count; adding an entry means raising it, in the same reviewed change.
# count: 0
